    "detailed_description": "Pump the atomic bot to the limit! Defeat the evil monsters!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is a boss waiting for you on each planet with his army of opponents, unique secrets. Surviving helpers who will help you in this difficult battle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game supports controls: mouse, keyboard, controllers and touch screens.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA unique weapon leveling system: weapons can be pumped to insane limits, besides, the game has synergies that can increase the power of your bot + the power of the elements, which falls out of reinforced opponents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach race will be unique because random events will happen every time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful with the questions.: they can fundamentally change the course of the game",
